# React Frontend

- To chuc code theo feature: auth, recipes, search, bookmarks, collections, cooksnaps, comments, profiles, challenges.
- Component chi quan ly UI va interaction.
- Goi API qua service hoac custom hook, khong goi truc tiep trong JSX phuc tap.
- Dung React Query cho server state neu da duoc cai dat.
- Dung React Hook Form cho form dai va form cong thuc.
- Khong dat business logic phuc tap trong component.
- Moi request bat dong bo phai co loading, empty, error va success state.
- Khoa nut submit khi request dang xu ly.
- Hien thi loi validation gan truong input.
- Dung `aria-label` cho icon button.
- Anh phai co `alt`, lazy loading va kich thuoc on dinh.
- Khong de text tran khoi container tren mobile.
- Khong dung mock data nhu du lieu that sau khi API da co.
- Khong them card long trong card neu khong can thiet.
- Giu layout responsive cho mobile, tablet va desktop.
